00:23:25,529 --> 00:23:26,446
Oh. 

514
00:23:28,073 --> 00:23:29,449
Thank God I have you.

515
00:23:31,243 --> 00:23:33,078
That's a very nice thing to say.

516
00:23:33,954 --> 00:23:36,081
-Oh, I like that.
-That one? Pretty.

517
00:23:38,667 --> 00:23:39,626
[knocking on door] 

518
00:23:40,168 --> 00:23:41,044
Yeah?

519
00:23:41,503 --> 00:23:45,757
The Prospector Satellite
is now in orbit around the moon.

520
00:23:45,841 --> 00:23:48,301
Good! Is the camera transmitting yet?

521
00:23:48,385 --> 00:23:51,012
Yes, sir. Uh, we have our first images.

522
00:23:51,096 --> 00:23:52,347
Very good.

523
00:23:52,806 --> 00:23:55,016
Oh, excellent.

524
00:23:56,101 --> 00:23:58,353
Oh, that's a beautiful shot.

525
00:23:58,437 --> 00:24:00,981
[Chan] You might enjoy
scrolling through these quickly.

526
00:24:03,024 --> 00:24:03,942
[Mark] What is that?

527
00:24:05,610 --> 00:24:08,822
Oh... We're not 100 percent sure
what that is yet.

528
00:24:12,617 --> 00:24:14,077
The Chinese flag.

529
00:24:14,161 --> 00:24:15,662
[Chan] What?

530
00:24:16,121 --> 00:24:17,747
-Oh.
-What?

531
00:24:18,248 --> 00:24:19,583
-Did-- Did you--
-Oh!

532
00:24:19,666 --> 00:24:21,460
Wow! Look at that!

533
00:24:22,043 --> 00:24:24,254
I had no idea they were that far along.

534
00:24:24,337 --> 00:24:26,465
-That's something.
-Huh. 

535
00:24:26,548 --> 00:24:28,592
Oh, good for them!

536
00:24:28,758 --> 00:24:30,969
That's great.

537
00:24:31,052 --> 00:24:33,597
Got a... [laughing] 

538
00:24:34,097 --> 00:24:36,683
Oh, I am happy for them.

539
00:24:37,225 --> 00:24:38,685
They really are there.

540
00:24:38,768 --> 00:24:39,978
Look at that.

541
00:24:41,021 --> 00:24:42,314
[laughs] 

542
00:24:43,106 --> 00:24:45,233
Oh, shit!

543
00:24:45,775 --> 00:24:49,070
Those Chinese bastards did it.

544
00:24:49,696 --> 00:24:50,906
They did it!

545
00:24:51,698 --> 00:24:54,493
Ha! That is rich.

546
00:24:54,576 --> 00:24:56,369
[chortles]

547
00:24:56,495 --> 00:24:58,496
[theme music plays]

